<h3>type='record': one row</h3>
{albums type='record', $album_id=3}<p><b>{$title}</b>, {$released}, {$price}</p>{/albums}

<h3>type='field': one value</h3>
<p>Albums: {albums type='field', fields="count(*)"}</p>
<p>Average price: {albums type='field', fields="round(avg(price), 2)"}</p>
<p>Longest track: {tracks type='field', fields="max(seconds)"} seconds</p>
